@startuml
' Catálogo de historietas: lectura, reacciones por viñeta y likes.
' Fuente: modules/story-history (StoryCatalogController, StoryHistoryService).
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 14

actor "Jugador" as Player
participant "LP-MOB\n(Explorar / My stories)" as Mobile
participant "StoryCatalogController\n(/story/catalog)" as Ctrl
participant "StoryHistoryService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "StoryUrlSigner\n(S3)" as Signer

note over Ctrl: JwtAuthGuard (cualquier usuario autenticado)

== Explorar ==
Player -> Mobile: Buscar y filtrar por nivel
Mobile -> Ctrl: GET /story/catalog?search&level&page
Ctrl -> Service: listCatalog(userId, filtros)
Service -> DB: historietas PUBLISHED
Service -> DB: likes de la página (una consulta agrupada)
Service -> Signer: portada y avatares firmados
Ctrl --> Mobile: página de historietas (con likes)

== Leer una historieta ==
Player -> Mobile: Abrir historieta
Mobile -> Ctrl: GET /story/catalog/:storyId
Service -> DB: historieta, viñetas, participantes, likes
Service -> Signer: audio e imágenes firmados
Ctrl --> Mobile: manifiesto + likes + reacciones permitidas

== Reaccionar a una viñeta ==
Player -> Mobile: Tocar un emoji
Mobile -> Mobile: actualización optimista
Mobile -> Ctrl: PUT /story/catalog/:storyId/panels/:order/reaction { emoji | null }
Ctrl -> Service: react
Service -> DB: UPDATE story_panel.reactions (jsonb atómico,\nsolo si la historieta está publicada)
Ctrl --> Mobile: reacciones de la viñeta
alt error
  Mobile -> Mobile: deshace el cambio y muestra el error
end

== Like a la historieta ==
Player -> Mobile: Tocar Like
Mobile -> Ctrl: PUT /story/catalog/:storyId/like\n(o DELETE para quitarlo)
Service -> DB: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING\n(o DELETE)
Ctrl --> Mobile: { count, likedByMe }

@enduml
